   "body": "Porting the layered Icon-RedFace3D.icon is a good call. Side note from me: I made a small CLI that turns an .icon or .appiconset into a blueprint-style Debug version (like the Xcode beta icon), so Debug and release installs are easy to tell apart. You can also do it by hand with a separate AppIconDebug set in Build Settings. Would love to know if it works on your icon, tell me if it breaks: https://github.com/MustafaNatur/blueprint",
